          "title": "The probability of picking one",
          "body": "The probability of picking one red and one green in either order is\n\n\\[\n\\frac{5}{x}\\cdot\\frac{x-5}{x}+\\frac{x-5}{x}\\cdot\\frac{5}{x}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{10(x-5)}{x^2}\n\\]"
        },
