          "body": "So\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{10(x-5)}{x^2}=\\frac{19}{32}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\frac{11x-50}{x^2}=\\frac{19}{32}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n32(11x-50)=19x^2\n\\]\n\n\\[\n19x^2-352x+1600=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(x-8)(19x-200)=0\n\\]"
